u(x)      = x**2/(x + 1)
g_c/a0(x) = x/(x + 1)
M_c(x)    = M_b/x
dx/dr     = -2*x*(x + 1)/(r*(x + 2))
rho_c     = M_b*(x + 1)/(2*pi*r**3*x*(x + 2))
rho_c (closed form) = M_b*(x + 1)/(2*pi*r**3*x*(x + 2))

settle-down equation (rho_c = rho_L): (-pi*G**(3/2)*sqrt(M_b)*rho_L*sqrt(x + 1)*(x + 2) + a0**(3/2)*x**2/2)/(pi*G**(3/2)*sqrt(M_b)*sqrt(x + 1)*(x + 2))
rho_c/rho_L = a0**(3/2)*x**2/(2*pi*G**(3/2)*sqrt(M_b)*rho_L*sqrt(x + 1)*(x + 2))
2 pi Xi     = 2*pi*G**(3/2)*sqrt(M_b)*rho_L/a0**(3/2)
check reduction (rho_c/rho_L - lhs/(2 pi Xi)): 0
settle-down condition:  x^2/((2+x) sqrt(1+x)) = 2 pi Xi,  Xi = rho_L G^(3/2) sqrt(M_b)/a0^(3/2)

K(x)       = 3*(x + 2)/(2*(x + 1))
K(x -> 0)  = 3
K(x -> oo) = 3/2
K range    = [3/2, 3]
1/2 - K_min = -1  -> 1/2 in range? False
K small-x  = 3*x**2/2 - 3*x/2 + 3

saturated  rho_c = a0/(2*pi*G*r)  (n = 1)
isothermal rho_c = sqrt(M_b)*sqrt(a0)/(4*pi*sqrt(G)*r**2)  (n = 2)
generic n  K     = Piecewise((-3/(n - 3), (n > 3) | (n < 3)), (oo, True))  -> K(n=1)=3/2 K(n=2)=3

turnaround: M/M_Lambda = 2    (independent of the law -> tautology)

